1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,360
Oo look at that there's like a foot and a half deep pile of leaves here it is really luxurious.
哦，看这里！这里的落叶堆大概有一英尺半深，真像一张豪华的床。

2
00:00:09,599 --> 00:00:13,320
Oh this is pretty nice oh this is a tough call.
这里真不错。哦，这可有点难决定。

3
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:18,400
This is about 2 hours and two miles before I was going to start looking for a campsite.
这里比我原计划开始寻找营地的地方，早了约两小时、两英里。

4
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:24,030
But this is pretty awesome there's such an enormous pile of dry leaves here it's really soft.
但这里太棒了，有这么大一堆干树叶，真的很柔软。

5
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:30,320
And with this rock acting as a heat reflector if I built a campfire here I'd be so warm.
他觉得，利用这块岩石反射热量，如果在这里生篝火，自己会很暖和。

6
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:33,880
I need to eat some lunch while I think about this.
我得先吃点午饭，边吃边想。

7
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:38,710
Got some cheese and dried dates love it.
我带了些奶酪和干椰枣，太喜欢了。

8
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:52,279
I always bring way too much food on these campouts like going to bed hungry is not an option for me.
我露营时总是带太多吃的，因为我可不能饿着肚子睡觉。

9
00:00:52,279 --> 00:00:59,960
Oh I love my water flask took some doing to get it 100 watertight but uh hasn't dropped a drip all day.
哦，我很喜欢这个水壶。费了些工夫才让它完全不漏水，但今天一整天一滴也没漏。

10
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:05,559
I know it's a risk but I want to go find a different campsite as comfy as this would be.
我知道有风险，但我还是想找另一个营地，尽管这里会很舒服。

11
00:01:05,559 --> 00:01:09,910
I really would like some place a little closer to some water.
我真的更想找个离水源近一点的地方。

12
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:44,990
All right here's another campsite that wouldn't be too bad it's flat dry sheltered and no water.
好，这里还有一个营地，也不错：平坦、干燥、有遮挡，就是没有水。

13
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:50,760
This is weird this looks like the remnants of an underground forest fire.
真奇怪，这看起来像地下林火留下的痕迹。

14
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:56,839
All the trees over here look like they've been burned below the soil line but only below the soil line.
这边所有的树看起来都在土壤线以下烧过，但只有土壤线以下是这样。

15
00:01:56,839 --> 00:02:03,720
Looks like the roots have been burned but the tree is still alive.
看起来树根烧过，但树仍然活着。

16
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:09,240
I mean that's charcoal right there I've heard about forest fires smoldering underground br.
那儿就是木炭。我听说过林火会在地下闷烧。

17
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:17,839
That's weird looking hey look what I found I think that's somebody's pepper spray.
这看着真怪。嘿，看我发现了什么！我想那是某人的防身喷雾。

18
00:02:17,839 --> 00:02:20,510
Somebody must have dropped this while they were getting eaten by a bear.
他开玩笑说，有人一定是在被熊吃掉时弄丢了这个。

19
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:32,400
Yeah look at that oh yep ain't no bears taking advantage of me tonight that's my purse I don't know you.
是啊，看看这个。今晚可没熊能欺负我了。“这是我的包，我不认识你！”

20
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:50,239
Quite a few spider webs on this trail I don't think anyone's walked this for at least a few days.
这条路上有不少蜘蛛网，我觉得至少好几天没人走过了。

21
00:02:50,239 --> 00:02:56,279
I just getting coated in spiderwebs that was a big one there's another one.
我都快被蛛网包住了。刚才那个好大，这里又一个。

22
00:02:56,279 --> 00:03:01,399
There's another one every 3 or 4 feet I'm going through a spiderweb.
又一个。每走三四英尺，我就会穿过一张蜘蛛网。

23
00:03:01,399 --> 00:03:06,640
Hold this stick out in front of you let it clear out all the spider webs.
作者把棍子举在前面，让它先把蛛网拨开。

24
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:27,640
Problem the problem yeah that was deeper than it looked.
麻烦，真麻烦。是啊，那比看起来要深。
